        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "For odd $n\\geq3$, a double path with its sole loop at the central\nvertex allows but does not require nSSP when $n\\equiv1\\pmod4$,\nand does not allow nSSP when $n\\equiv3\\pmod4$.\nFor every $n\\geq4$, the path with loops at all interior vertices\nallows but does not require nSSP; for $1\\leq n\\leq3$ it does not allow nSSP.\nThe pattern with $n=1$ and its one loop requires nSSP.\nEvery directed superpattern of an allowing path also allows nSSP,\nwith a positive-integer witness.",
